    },
    {
      "id": "DS-R2",
      "reason": "S-1 to S-4 each map to components, and every AC is covered. That includes latest COMPLETED, the Asia/Kolkata date with an AC3 API test, '-' for null, unchanged paging/search/sort/Next, no sort option, no highlight and no medical columns.",
      "score": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "DS-R3",
      "reason": "Method and path are exact. last_visit is exact: string | null, YYYY-MM-DD in HOSPITAL_TZ. JSON and TS shapes are given for both row types, and HOSPITAL_TZ is passed as a bound parameter.",
      "score": 5
    },
    {
